OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and night.
OL,7,FA little light rain or drizzle is
OL,8,Fpossible in the evening, and then
OL,9,Flater in the night across northern
OL,10,FAberdeenshire.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA mainly dry but cloudy
OL,13,Fmorning. Outbreaks of rain will spread
OL,14,Facross from the west later in the
OL,15,Fafternoon, turning persistent and
OL,16,Foccasionally heavier later on.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
